      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING HUGO (2) can keep on winning after a brilliant last start success, getting around the 305m at this track in 17.47. In form and rates on top again. CHEQUES TO BURN (5) tends to take a while to wind up, missing the placings two back but running on to last time finishing third (17.99) in a Other at this track. Solid record at the distance winning 13 races. Has performed well from this box with a win and five minor placings to her name from nine starts. Expected to be in this for a long way. GALBA STACEY (7) pinged the lids last start from an awkward draw and led throughout to score (17.31) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 305m. Form from her last run is proving strong. Will go close again if runs up to latest. COMPTON LASS (1) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at her latest outing at this circuit.",
